  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kweyo (KGCS) Groundnuts Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Food Production and Processing (Groundnuts), Beneficiaries: 386 farmers (290 female), Summary: The project funds will be used to construct a peanut butter processing facility to increase groundnut value, facilitate transportation of produce to collection centers and the main storage facility, and provide additional crop finance to smallholder farmers in Northern Uganda.</narrative>
  </description>
